/E (The developed model provides a useful framework for identifying purchase-oriented sessions from session-level e-commerce data.The final Gradient Boosting model achieved an F1-score of 69.46%, with a recall of 73.82% and ROC-AUC of 93.20% on the test set. However, the analysis also demonstrates that predictive performance alone does not explain the complete purchase journey.)
