/Title (The combination of exploratory analysis, model evaluation, error investigation, and explainability provides a broader understanding of how browsing behavior and session characteristics relate to purchase conversion. The project therefore demonstrates not only the development of a predictive classification model, but also the use of machine learning as a framework for understanding e-commerce conversion behavior and translating analytical results into practical business insights.)
